============================================================================================
S605  the resonance energy (key LRC concept) and the SIDESTEP (construction/additive face)
============================================================================================

[1] THE BOUND (HYP-2053): |LONELY| ≥ main - E(v); E<main ⇒ LRC proven (else high-energy core)
  config              n  | main=(1-2/n)^{n-1} | resonance energy E(v) | E<main? | regime
  AP {1..5} core       6 | 0.1317             | 0.3553                | False   | HIGH-ENERGY CORE (energy blind)
  AP {1..6} core       7 | 0.1328             | 0.5948                | False   | HIGH-ENERGY CORE (energy blind)
  Fibonacci 1,2,3,5,8  6 | 0.1317             | 0.2573                | False   | HIGH-ENERGY CORE (energy blind)
  generic 3,5,11,17,29  6 | 0.1317             | 0.0708                | True    | BULK: LRC proven by energy
  Sidon 1,2,5,11,22    6 | 0.1317             | 0.1151                | True    | BULK: LRC proven by energy
  transl {7..11}       6 | 0.1317             | 0.0999                | True    | BULK: LRC proven by energy

