  Sidon 1,2,5,11,22   | l=3:0.045  l=4:0.019  l=5:0.008  l=6:0.023  l=7:0.009  l=8:0.004  l=9:0.003  l=10:0.002  l=11:0.001  l=12:0.000  l=13:0.000  l=14:0.000  l=15:0.000  l=16:0.000  l=17:0.000  l=18:0.000
